<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά-πτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>falling beside, lying side by side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				718a28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>falling from the right way</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ καθήκοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					15.23.5
				</span></i>
			 : abs., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράπτωμα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				16.20.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Je.</u>
				22.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.17
			</span></i> O.; grammatical <i>mistake</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.210
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ τόπου π</span>. the
			<i>situation</i> of a place <i>off the road</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.32.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ &lt;τὴν&gt; τοῦ διώγματος
			π</span>. in the <i>course</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				11.17.3
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν ἐπὶ τοὺς κελτοὺς
			π</span>. as they were <i>pursuing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.115.11
			</span></i>.</div>
